OL,3,GNEWSAMum revives play after daughter's
OL,4,Acancer death
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking ahead of the performance, Gail
OL,7,Fsaid: "I sometimes wonder if she wrote
OL,8,Fit as a self-help manual for me, and
OL,9,Fthe people that are left in life who
OL,10,Fmiss her so much."
